    <string name="about_text">AMARadio bụ 100% n\'efu site na mgbasa ozi na-eleba anya na nzuzo.\n\nM malitere imepụta ngwa a maka nne m iji nye ya ahụmịhe redio dị mfe ma doo anya na-enweghị mgbasa ozi na-ewe iwe ma ọ bụ nsuso. Wueru AMARadio ga-anọ n\'efu site na mgbasa ozi mgbe niile – nke a bụ nkwa nye ya, nke m soro gị niile kerịta.\n\nEbe a bụ gị fork nke egwu doro anya RadioDroid. A kpaliri koodu niile site na Java gaa na Kotlin iji hụ na ngwa a dị ọhụrụ ma dakọtara na ụdị Android n\'ọdịnihu.\n\nKoodu mbụ dị na: https://github.com/ounben/AMARadio\n\nNgwa a na-eji ndekọ ụlọ redio n\'efu na https://www.radio-browser.info .\nOnye ọ bụla nwere ike itinye ụlọ redio. Yana-aiki dị ka wiki maka ụlọ redio n\'ịntanetị.\n\nMmekọrịta: ben@ounben.com\n\nIhe matsaloli: https://github.com/ounben/AMARadio/issues\n\nỌ bụrụ na ị nwere mmasị na ngwa ngwa ma chọọ inye aka, zillere m ozi e-mail.\nA na-anabata echiche maka njirimara ọhụrụ mgbe niile!\n\nNgwa a bụ ngwanrọ n\'efu n\'okpuru GPLv3. https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html</string>
